{"id":"c36416a8-c6a3-4040-bd34-f0dc23f9baf8","rule_id":"1c27fa22-7727-4dd3-81c0-de6da5555feb","name":"【默认】Linux疑似内部地址暴力破解","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"max_signals"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":17,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:49.737Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:27.275Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测来自内网地址的 主机 登录失败后短时间集中尝试。对应需求：用户登录失败。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","对应需求: 登录失败"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1110","name":"Brute Force","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1110.001","name":"Password Guessing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/001/"},{"id":"T1110.003","name":"Password Spraying","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/003/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.004","name":"SSH","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004/"}]}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","host.id","user.name","user.id","source.ip","source.port","event.action","event.outcome","event.category","message","event.original","related.user","related.ip","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.action","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.outcome","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.id","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"source.ip","type":"ip","ecs":true},{"name":"user.name","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n内网源对主机发起疑似爆破。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是横向移动或失陷主机扩散。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 定位源主机责任人。\n2. 检查源主机是否已失陷。\n3. 关联成功登录。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["内网自动化探活使用错误密码"],"references":[],"risk_score":47,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"medium","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["filebeat-*","logs-system.auth-*"],"query":"sequence by host.id, source.ip, user.name with maxspan=30s\n  [ authentication where host.os.type == \"linux\" and \n   event.action in (\"ssh_login\", \"user_login\") and event.outcome == \"failure\" and\n   cidrmatch(source.ip, \"10.0.0.0/8\", \"127.0.0.0/8\", \"169.254.0.0/16\", \"172.16.0.0/12\", \"192.0.0.0/24\",\n       \"192.0.0.0/29\", \"192.0.0.8/32\", \"192.0.0.9/32\", \"192.0.0.10/32\", \"192.0.0.170/32\", \"192.0.0.171/32\",\n       \"192.0.2.0/24\", \"192.31.196.0/24\", \"192.52.193.0/24\", \"192.168.0.0/16\", \"192.88.99.0/24\", \"224.0.0.0/4\",\n       \"100.64.0.0/10\", \"192.175.48.0/24\",\"198.18.0.0/15\", \"198.51.100.0/24\", \"203.0.113.0/24\", \"240.0.0.0/4\", \n       \"::1\", \"FE80::/10\", \"FF00::/8\") ] with runs = 60\n"}
